{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Stdlib.Array</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"melange","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Melange_compiler_libs","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Misc","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Stdlib","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Array","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Extensions to the Array module","href":"#extensions-to-the-array-module","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h3 id=\"extensions-to-the-array-module\"><a href=\"#extensions-to-the-array-module\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Extensions to the Array module</h3><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-exists2\"><a href=\"#val-exists2\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> exists2 : <span><span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Same as <code>Array.exists2</code> from the standard library.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-for_alli\"><a href=\"#val-for_alli\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> for_alli : <span><span>(<span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Same as <code>Array.for_all</code> from the standard library, but the function is applied with the index of the element as first argument, and the element itself as second argument.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-all_somes\"><a href=\"#val-all_somes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> all_somes : <span><span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> option</span> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> array</span> option</span></span></code></div></div>"}